{
  "name": "Aasani Lead Capture System",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Aasani Lead Capture System\n\n**Purpose:** Capture leads from Framer website form and process them\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Receive webhook from Framer form\n2. Validate & clean data\n3. Check for duplicate in Notion CRM\n4. Create or update Notion record\n5. Send auto-reply to lead\n6. Notify owner (Email + Slack)\n7. Return success response\n\n**Credentials Required:**\n- Notion Aasani HQ (OAuth2)\n- Google Workspace - Ayub (Gmail)\n- Slack (optional)\n\n**Webhook URL:**\n`https://axistential.app.n8n.cloud/webhook/lead-capture`",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [-200, -100],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "intro-note",
      "name": "Intro Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "lead-capture",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "rawBody": false
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 200],
      "id": "webhook-lead-capture",
      "name": "Webhook - Lead Form",
      "webhookId": "aasani-lead-capture"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Validate and Clean Lead Data\nconst input = $input.first().json;\nconst body = input.body || input;\n\n// Extract fields with defaults\nconst name = (body.name || '').trim();\nconst email = (body.email || '').trim().toLowerCase();\nconst company = (body.company || '').trim();\nconst phone = (body.phone || '').trim();\nconst message = (body.message || '').trim();\n\n// Validation - name and email are required\nif (!name) {\n  throw new Error('Name is required');\n}\nif (!email || !email.includes('@')) {\n  throw new Error('Valid email is required');\n}\n\n// Extract company domain from email if company not provided\nlet companyName = company;\nif (!companyName && email.includes('@')) {\n  const domain = email.split('@')[1];\n  // Skip common email providers\n  const commonProviders = ['gmail.com', 'yahoo.com', 'hotmail.com', 'outlook.com', 'icloud.com', 'aol.com', 'protonmail.com'];\n  if (!commonProviders.includes(domain)) {\n    // Capitalize domain name\n    companyName = domain.split('.')[0].charAt(0).toUpperCase() + domain.split('.')[0].slice(1);\n  }\n}\n\n// Format phone number (basic cleanup)\nlet formattedPhone = phone.replace(/[^0-9+]/g, '');\nif (formattedPhone && !formattedPhone.startsWith('+')) {\n  formattedPhone = '+1' + formattedPhone; // Default to US\n}\n\n// Generate dates\nconst today = new Date();\nconst tomorrow = new Date(today);\ntomorrow.setDate(tomorrow.getDate() + 1);\n\nconst todayISO = today.toISOString().split('T')[0];\nconst tomorrowISO = tomorrow.toISOString().split('T')[0];\nconst timestamp = today.toISOString();\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    // Cleaned data\n    name,\n    email,\n    company: companyName || 'Unknown',\n    phone: formattedPhone || null,\n    message: message || 'No message provided',\n    \n    // Metadata\n    source: 'Website',\n    stage: 'New Lead',\n    next_action: 'Follow up within 24 hours',\n    next_action_date: tomorrowISO,\n    last_contact_date: todayISO,\n    timestamp,\n    \n    // For duplicate check\n    email_lower: email\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [220, 200],
      "id": "code-validate-data",
      "name": "Validate & Clean Data"
    },
